<!--
  Themed-icon layer for Android 13+. The <monochrome> slot used to point at the colour
  foreground, which the system flattens to a single tint — the church, the sun and the
  lettering all collapsed into one blob. This is the same fish as the notification icon,
  scaled from its 24dp grid into the 108dp adaptive canvas: 24 * 2.58 = 62dp of artwork,
  centred with a 23dp margin, which keeps it inside the 72dp safe zone.
-->
